=1717791442\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146290/extras/cb9630c5c3910bc6b5231146fd278dd5.webm?t=1717791442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146290/extras/cb9630c5c3910bc6b5231146fd278dd5.mp4?t=1717791442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Caster's primary goal is to <i>catch fish</i>! Thwack'em,  snag'em, and bring'em home to put The Big Catch back on the map. But is that all there is to this tale? The whisper on the wind tells of a dark past, a sinister plot, and ominous otherworldly entities. To find out more, <i>you'll just have to see for yourself</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146290/extras/d5269314c4858514d13e44a0e4cc4dce.avif?t=1717791442\" /></div>",
